    <p data-reveal>Please don't use it instead of real support. If something you're going through feels like too much, talk to a professional you trust.</p>
    <p data-reveal><strong>If you're in crisis or thinking about ending your life, please reach out now.</strong> <a href="#crisis">Find help near you</a></p>
